     'Onychophilia is attraction focused on nails — their length, shape, colour or the sensation of them. It frequently appears alongside hand and foot fetishism.'),
    ('pubephilia', 'Pubephilia', 'fetishes-interests', 'concept', true, true, true,
     'Sexual attraction to pubic hair.',
     'Pubephilia is attraction focused on pubic hair — its presence, quantity or styling. It sits alongside the broader trichophilia, which covers hair generally.'),
    ('armpit-fetish', 'Armpit Fetish', 'fetishes-interests', 'concept', true, true, true,
     'Sexual attraction to armpits, sometimes called maschalagnia.',
     'An armpit fetish is attraction focused on the underarm — its appearance, hair or scent. It overlaps with scent-based interests, and hygiene preferences vary widely between people who share it.'),
    ('belly-button-fetish', 'Belly Button Fetish', 'fetishes-interests', 'concept', true, true, true,
     'Sexual attraction to the navel, also called alvinolagnia.',
     'A belly button fetish is attraction focused on the navel and the surrounding stomach, whether through looking, touching or play directed there.'),
    ('ear-fetish', 'Ear Fetish', 'fetishes-interests', 'concept', true, true, true,
