     'An ear fetish is attraction focused on the ears — their shape, piercings, or stimulation of them. It often overlaps with interests in sound, whispering and breath.'),
    ('neck-fetish', 'Neck Fetish', 'fetishes-interests', 'concept', true, true, true,
     'Sexual attraction to the neck and throat.',
     'A neck fetish is attraction focused on the neck — its appearance, or kissing, biting and marking there. It is distinct from breath play or choking, which carry serious physical risk and are a separate practice with their own safety requirements.'),
    ('glasses-fetish', 'Glasses Fetish', 'fetishes-interests', 'concept', true, true, true,
     'Sexual attraction to people wearing glasses.',
     'A glasses fetish is attraction to eyewear and to partners wearing it. It sits with other clothing and accessory-based interests, where the object contributes to the appeal rather than being incidental.'),
    ('nylon-fetish', 'Nylon Fetish', 'fetishes-interests', 'concept', true, true, true,
     'Sexual attraction to nylon garments, especially hosiery.',
     'A nylon fetish is attraction to the material — tights, stockings and similar garments — for their texture, sheen and sound as much as their appearance. It is one of the longest-documented material fetishes.'),
    ('stockings-fetish', 'Stockings Fetish', 'fetishes-interests', 'concept', true, true, true,
     'Sexual attraction to stockings and the way they are worn.',
     'A stockings fetish is attraction focused on stockings, suspenders and hold-ups — how they look, how they feel, and often the ritual of putting them on or removing them.'),
    ('smoking-fetish', 'Smoking Fetish', 'fetishes-interests', 'concept', true, true, true,
     'Sexual attraction to the act or imagery of smoking, sometimes called capnolagnia.',
     'A smoking fetish is arousal connected to smoking — watching a partner smoke, the gestures involved, or the associated imagery. The health harms of tobacco apply regardless of context, and some people who share the interest keep it to imagery for that reason.'),
    ('balloon-fetish', 'Balloon Fetish', 'fetishes-interests', 'concept', true, true, true,
     'Sexual attraction to balloons, often called looning.',
     'A balloon fetish, known in its own community as looning, is arousal connected to balloons — inflating them, the texture and sound, and for some the anticipation or moment of popping. Participants generally divide into "poppers" and "non-poppers" by whether the burst is part of the appeal. Latex allergy is a practical consideration.'),
    ('cast-fetish', 'Cast Fetish', 'fetishes-interests', 'concept', true, true, true,
     'Sexual attraction to orthopaedic casts and braces.',
     'A cast fetish is attraction to plaster or fibreglass casts, braces and splints, whether worn by a partner or oneself. It overlaps with abasiophilia. Applying a real cast without medical need carries genuine risk of circulation and skin injury.'),
    ('robot-fetish', 'Robot Fetish', 'fetishes-interests', 'concept', true, true, true,
     'Sexual attraction to robots, androids or people acting mechanically.',
     'A robot fetish, sometimes called technosexuality or ASFR, covers attraction to robots and androids in fiction and imagery, and to partners who take on mechanical or programmed behaviour in roleplay. It overlaps with transformation and objectification interests.'),
    ('transformation-fetish', 'Transformation Fetish', 'fetishes-interests', 'concept', true, true, true,
     'Sexual attraction to the idea of a body or identity being changed into something else.',
     'A transformation fetish centres on change itself — a body, gender, species or role becoming something different. It is overwhelmingly a fantasy and fiction interest, expressed in writing and art, and it covers a wide range from gradual bodily change to instantaneous transformation.'),
    ('cum-fetish', 'Cum Fetish', 'fetishes-interests', 'concept', true, true, true,
     'Sexual attraction focused on semen.',
     'A cum fetish is arousal focused on semen — its appearance, taste, or where it ends up. Semen transmits HIV and several other sexually transmitted infections, so the usual risk-reduction questions about testing, PrEP and barriers apply.'),
    ('wetlook', 'Wetlook', 'fetishes-interests', 'concept', true, true, true,
     'Sexual attraction to people in wet clothing.',
     'Wetlook is arousal from seeing people fully clothed while soaked — in a pool, shower, rain or sea. The clothing staying on is the point; the interest is distinct from wet-and-messy play, which uses substances other than water.'),
    ('agonophilia', 'Agonophilia', 'fetishes-interests', 'concept', true, true, true,
     'Sexual arousal from a partner pretending to struggle or resist.',
     'Agonophilia is arousal from simulated struggle or resistance. In practice it is a form of consensual non-consent, which depends completely on negotiation done in advance, an agreed safeword or signal that works when speech is restricted, and aftercare. Without those it is not this practice.'),
    ('bimbofication', 'Bimbofication', 'fetishes-interests', 'concept', true, true, true,
     'A transformation fantasy of becoming, or making someone, exaggeratedly feminine and hypersexual.',
     'Bimbofication is a transformation kink in which a person is imagined or roleplayed as becoming stereotypically hyperfeminine and hypersexual. It is most often a fantasy and aesthetic, and it is practised both as something done to a submissive partner and as a self-directed identity that some people embrace on their own terms.'),
    ('power-top', 'Power Top', 'bdsm-power-exchange', 'concept', true, true, true,
     'Someone who tops with particular energy, stamina or forcefulness.',
     'A power top is a partner who takes the penetrative role assertively and vigorously. The term describes intensity and style rather than a distinct role, and it is used mainly in gay male contexts.'),
    ('total-top', 'Total Top', 'bdsm-power-exchange', 'concept', true, true, true,
     'Someone who only ever takes the penetrative role.',
     'A total top exclusively tops and does not bottom. The term marks the absence of versatility rather than any judgement about it.'),
    ('total-bottom', 'Total Bottom', 'bdsm-power-exchange', 'concept', true, true, true,
     'Someone who only ever takes the receptive role.',
     'A total bottom exclusively bottoms and does not top. As with total top, it describes a fixed preference rather than a hierarchy.'),
    ('vers-top', 'Vers Top', 'bdsm-power-exchange', 'concept', true, true, true,
     'A versatile partner who prefers topping.',
     'Vers top describes someone comfortable in both roles who leans toward topping. The term exists because "versatile" alone says nothing about which way a person leans, which matters when people are matching.'),
    ('vers-bottom', 'Vers Bottom', 'bdsm-power-exchange', 'concept', true, true, true,
     'A versatile partner who prefers bottoming.',
     'Vers bottom describes someone comfortable in both roles who leans toward bottoming — the counterpart of vers top.'),
    ('muscle-bear', 'Muscle Bear', 'subcultures', 'concept', false, false, true,
