     'A twink chaser is a person attracted specifically to twinks — young-looking, slim, typically smooth men. "Chaser" is used across gay subcultures for directed attraction to a body type, and it carries a mildly loaded edge depending on who is using it.'),
    ('cub-chaser', 'Cub Chaser', 'subcultures', 'concept', false, false, true,
