    ('otter-chaser', 'Otter Chaser', 'subcultures', 'concept', false, false, true,
     'Someone attracted specifically to otters — slim, hairy men.',
     'An otter chaser is attracted to otters, meaning lean and hairy men, a body type that sits between twink and bear in the subculture''s vocabulary.'),
    ('silver-fox-chaser', 'Silver Fox Chaser', 'subcultures', 'concept', false, false, true,
     'Someone attracted specifically to attractive older, grey-haired men.',
     'A silver fox chaser is attracted to older men with grey or silver hair. It overlaps with daddy-directed attraction, with the emphasis on age and appearance rather than on a dominant role.'),
    ('muscle-chaser', 'Muscle Chaser', 'subcultures', 'concept', false, false, true,
     'Someone attracted specifically to heavily muscular partners.',
     'A muscle chaser is attracted to visibly built, muscular bodies. It overlaps with muscle worship, which is the practice rather than the preference.'),
    ('daddy-chaser', 'Daddy Chaser', 'subcultures', 'concept', true, true, true,
